        dct:title "A theory of biological pattern formation" .
    <https://doi.org/10.1007/s002850100133> dct:date "2002"^^xsd:gYear ;
        dct:title "A numerical approach to the study of spatial pattern formation in the ligaments of arcoid bivalves and on the wing of the butterfly Papilio dardanus" .
